  "description": "The catalog photo will not do\n\nthis Fuji justice. You could say that a Shakalaka is a single-speed cruiser\n\nwith a coaster brake, just as you could say a '57 Chevy BelAir Hardtop is\n\nan old car, but you'd be missing the point both times.\n\nShakalaka's frame and finish are breathtaking, the paint wet-looking, unique.\n\nIts components were chosen for function because it's a Fuji, but they are\n\nnot purely functional. They're gorgeous. Look at the photo, or far better, go down to your Fuji\n\nstore and feast your eyes on a flashy new Shakalaka. Check out that velvet\n\nseat. Grab the foam grip on the chrome swept-back Shakalaka handlebar, then\n\ntry to let go... Couldn't, could you?",
